Put

```text
q=2t+1,       e=3t+1,
H_t(y)=12q^2 y^2-12q(t+1)y+(t+1)(3t+2),
A_t=Q[y]/(H_t),
d=2qy-(t+1).
```

Direct substitution gives

```text
H_t((d+t+1)/(2q))=3d^2-(t+1).                         (1.1)
```

Thus `A_t=Q[d]/(3d^2-(t+1))`.  It is a separable rank-two algebra, not
