Equations (2.2)--(2.12), followed by

```text
T_(t,k)=-sum_(m>=k) binom(m,k)(-b4)^(m-k) R_m,
                                      0<=k<2t,        (2.13)
```

are the requested closed symbolic-`t` form.  Formula (2.13) is simply the
