+```text
+[ -8310084192/86249381545, 10387061461728/420707233300201 ]
+[       430272/17682025,       -8847063648/86249381545 ]
+```
+
+and
+
+```text
+det(mu_F0)=2762023282304080896/297558232675799463481 != 0. (3.5)
+```
+
+Therefore `TOP-TAIL-UNIT` is exact at `t=2`, but
