+Writing `lambda=a(t)d+b(t)`, direct symbolic pair arithmetic factors its norm
+as
+
+```text
+3b(t)^2-(t+1)a(t)^2
+= 9t^2(t-1)^6(t+1)(t+2)^6(3t+1)^2(4t+1)
+    *(25t^2+12t-12)
+  /[(2t+1)^6(t^2+3t+6)
+    *(27t^4+206t^3+527t^2+540t+300)^3].             (6.2)
+```
+
+For completeness, put
+
+```text
+P4(t)=27t^4+206t^3+527t^2+540t+300,
+Q2(t)=t^2+3t+6.                                      (6.3)
+```
