+```
+
+For each field factor `K_e` of `A_t`, suppose
+`B_(t,e)=B_t tensor_(A_t) K_e` is finite-dimensional.  Then
+
+```text
+<F_0,...,F_(t-1)>=[1] on K_e
+ iff B_(t,e)/F_0 B_(t,e)=0
+ iff mu_(F_0):B_(t,e)->B_(t,e) is bijective
+ iff det(mu_(F_0)|B_(t,e)) != 0.                    (3.2)
+```
