+weights divisible by `j` are `j` and `2j`.  Thus the only solves are
+`chi_1` (`c_j`) and `upsilon_2` (`u_(2j)`); since `3j>q`, no further
+`u` variable or `b2` occurs.  Replace `2Theta` by `jTheta` in (5.2) and use
