+2,3,q=2t+1,t+1,3t+2,
+t-2r                    (0<=r<=floor((t-1)/2)),
+4t-4r+1                 (0<=r<=t),
+t(3t+1)F_C(t,2r)        (1<=r<=floor((t-1)/2)),
+t(3t+1)(q-2r)F_Q(t,2r)  (ceil(t/2)<=r<=t).           (5.4)
