+```text
+3b^2-(t+1)a^2
+=9t^2(t-c)^6(t+1)(3t+1)^2(4t+1)(t+c+1)^6 G(t,c)
+ /[q^6 Q(t,c)P(t,c)^3].                              (6.5)
+```
