+Set `z=u2`, `s=z/X^2`, `Theta=s d/ds`, and
+`Delta_n=n-2Theta`.  The driver implements charged (6.4) coefficientwise:
+
+```text
+C=X^(t-1)chi(s), U=X^q upsilon(s), chi_0=1,
+upsilon_0=upsilon_1=1,
+beta_r=g(3t+2-6r)chi_r/(2y(t-2r)),
