+  +2 Delta_t(chi) beta,
+delta_r=f_r/(y(4t-4r+1)),
+xi={Delta_(t+1)(chi)delta-chi Delta_q(delta)
+    +2 Delta_q(upsilon)beta}/(2y),
+rho=chi xi-Delta_q(upsilon)delta.                   (5.2)
+```
