+```text
+2,3,6,q,q^2,q^3,t,e,t+1,3t+2,4t+1,
+m+1                    (0<=m<t),
+2m+1                   (0<=m<=2t),
+4t-2j+1                (C and Q pivot ranges),
+q-j                    (t<=j<=2t),
+F_C(t,j), F_Q(t,j), and constant factorial factors. (2.2)
+```
