+3b^2-(t+1)a^2
+=9t^2(t-1)^6(t+1)(t+2)^6(3t+1)^2(4t+1)
+  *(25t^2+12t-12)
+ /[q^6(t^2+3t+6)
+   *(27t^4+206t^3+527t^2+540t+300)^3].              (6.8)
