+Direct authenticated stored-`R` rows give
+`lambda=(-550304d+819920)/37500925` at `(t,j)=(5,4)` and
+`lambda=(-22519104d+36635648)/1349232625` at `(6,5)`; both agree exactly.
+Eight additional exact substitutions, including `(t,c)=(11,3)` and
+`(20,5)`, agree with the general fixed-axis recurrence.  At the exceptional
+small schedules `t=3,4`, the `j=t-1` axis also has nonzero exact norm (the
