+Consequently every outer-third coordinate-axis image has radical `(u_j)`.
+Precisely, (6.3) proves only
+
+```text
+u_j^3 in I_(t,+)+(b3,{u_i : 2<=i<t, i!=j}).          (6.9)
+```
