+Both are nonzero; this is an exact two-factor falsification check, not merely
+a mod-`1009` check.  Exact `N_t>0` also holds for every tested `3<=t<=20`.
+The observed signs are `sign(B_t)=(-1)^t`, `sign(A_t)=(-1)^(t+1)`, with
