+bound uses `3j>=2t+2`.
+
+Write `lambda_(t,j)=a(t,c)d+b(t,c)` and define
+
+```text
+P(t,c)=3c^4+24c^3t+42c^3+66c^2t^2+146c^2t+119c^2
