+## 5. Exact coefficient-pair execution of the `u2` recurrence
+
+Work in `K_t=Q(t)[d]/(3d^2-(t+1))` and store an element as the pair
+`(b,a)=b+ad`.  Pair multiplication and inversion are
+
+```text
+(b,a)(v,u)=(bv+(t+1)au/3, bu+av),
