+`upsilon_r` for `ceil(t/2)<=r<=t` with `p_Q(t,2r,d)`.  Setting each new
+coefficient first to zero and then one reproduces the charged pivot exactly;
+after substitution `rho_1=...=rho_t=0`.  An independent reconstruction of
