+## 2. Denominators already discharged by the terminal recurrence
+
+For an affine class `ad+b`,
+
+```text
+Res_y(H_t,ad+b)=4q^2(3b^2-a^2(t+1)),
+(ad+b)^(-1)=3(b-ad)/(3b^2-a^2(t+1)).                 (2.1)
+```
