+| `t` | coefficient computation | local lengths of `B_t` | determinant status |
+|---:|---|---:|---|
+| 2 | exact, `d=-1,+1` | `1,2` | exact nonzero, (3.4)--(3.5) |
+| 3 | exact quadratic field | `8` | exact nonzero |
