+The coefficient-array recurrence (charged (2.2)--(2.13)) inverts the algebra
+classes `y`, `3d+2(t+1)` (the class of `g`), `L_C`, `L_Q`, and
+`3qd+(t+1)` (the `b2` pivot).  Its rational/indexed factors are exactly
