+```text
+2,3,6,q,q^2,q^3,t,e,t+1,3t+2,4t+1,
+m+1                    (0<=m<t),
+2m+1                   (0<=m<=2t),
+4t-2j+1                (1<=j<t and t<=j<=2t),
+q-j                    (t<=j<=2t),
+F_C(t,j)               (1<=j<t),
+F_Q(t,j)               (t<=j<=2t),
+and constant factorial factors.                              (2.2)
+```
