+## 4. RESIDUAL-ZERO: the proved `b3` axis and its boundary
+
+Let
+
+```text
+I_(t,+)=<T_(t,1),...,T_(t,2t-1)>|_(b4=0).            (4.1)
+```
+
+On the `b3` coordinate axis the charged symbolic solve gives
+
+```text
+C=X^(t-1),
+U=X^(2t+1)+a b3 X^t,  b2=0,
+a=-(6dt-3d+9t^2+2t-1)/(6t(3t-1)),                  (4.2)
