+```text
+P(t,c)=3c^4+24c^3t+42c^3+66c^2t^2+146c^2t+119c^2
+       +72ct^3+238ct^2+234ct+104c
+       +27t^4+134t^3+223t^2+136t+32,
+Q(t,c)=c^2+2ct+4c+t^2+t+1,
+G(t,c)=c^2-10ct-14c+25t^2+22t+1.                    (6.4)
