+cited Singular probe has stdout/stderr sidecars, empty stderr, and a terminal
+`PROBE_DONE` in stdout.  The orphan sources
+`probe_t4_exact_bNone.sing` and `probe_t6_mod_b0_det.sing` are interrupted
