+```text
+PARTIAL.
+(T) on the normalized K=16 ray is PROVED for t=1,2,3,4,5.
+The b4=0 half is additionally PROVED at t=6.
+The all-t TOP-TAIL-UNIT, RESIDUAL-ZERO, (8.1), and hence (T), remain OPEN.
