+ F1=-14(1189646642b3^2+304374720b3-1207034325)/371764575625. (3.3)
+```
+
+On the first factor, `B_(2,-)` has basis `(1)` and
+
+```text
+det(mu_F0)=287/1408 != 0.                            (3.4)
+```
+
+On the second, use `(1,b3)` after making `F1` monic.  The multiplication
+matrix is
