+and, for stored `R=-E`,
+
+```text
+[X^(2t-1)]R=lambda_b b3^2,
+lambda_b=t(3t+1)(A_b d+B_b)/
+         (12(2t+1)^2(3t-1)^2(3t+2)),
+A_b=27t^3-30t^2+t-2,
+B_b=6t^3+13t^2-3t+2.                                (4.3)
+```
+
+Its primitive norm factors as
